	(text "PS/2 KEYBOARD (ATmega328P), KEY LATCH (INP 1) AND -EF, STATUS (INP 4)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fa61633b-ca4f-539f-8a5e-bc8d453faa32"))
	(text "The ATmega loads IC9 with LDDATA, which also sets KEY-READY (IC24B); INP 1 clears it at TPB (IC20C, IC19B).\nKEY-READY pulls the bus -EF low through IC23D and JP3 (CPU JP1 row 3 = EF3: HBIOS unchanged). The bus -RESET resets\nthe ATmega through IC18B and IC23E/F. INP 4: KEY-READY, MOUSE-READY, VSYNC, DE, MONITOR (JP1), GFX-PRESENT, ID 10." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e536e675-334c-5bf6-8eee-668aa32e5cd4"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
